    "created_at": "2018-01-27T12:08:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-27T12:08:01Z",
    "body": "Context is that @rakuco and I are looking at a [normative spec change without tests](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kFYTqUMEbo9p87i6wAzORoicMWgHsuYwL2CgtvdhDaE/edit#heading=h.gn90gr74sg9s) every week this quarter to try to understand what's not working well in practice.\r\n\r\nIn this case I think the answer is *not* to do a careful search for existing tests for unimplemented features, but to auto-sync IDL: https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/issues/7784. And tests for unimplemented features that remain behind will fail everywhere, and we'll have other ways of finding those soon: https://github.com/w3c/wptdashboard/issues/83. @mdittmer FYI :)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
